sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as 前端
    participant API as 控制面 API
    participant SV as ConfigService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant HUB as AgentHub(WS)
    participant AG as Edge Agent
    participant SB as sing-box

    Note over UI,SB: 场景A：配置保存与下发

    UI->>API: PUT /api/v1/inbounds/:id (保存配置)
    API->>SV: UpdateInbound(...)
    SV->>SV: ① 业务校验(tag唯一/端口/引用)
    SV->>DB: 保存中立模型
    SV-->>API: 返回
    API-->>UI: 200

    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/config/deploy {node_id}
    API->>SV: Deploy(nodeID)
    SV->>DB: 聚合 group+node 配置 + 解密 proxy users
    SV->>SV: ② Generate() 渲染 sing-box JSON
    SV->>SV: ③ gojsonschema 校验
    SV->>DB: 写 ConfigVersion(draft, 加密快照, hash, version+1)
    SV->>HUB: config_push(version, content)
    HUB->>AG: config_push
    AG->>AG: ④ sing-box check -c 预校验
    AG->>AG: ⑤ 备份旧配置 config.json.bak
    AG->>AG: 写入新配置
    AG->>SB: ⑥ reload(信号/API)
    AG->>AG: ⑦ 校验进程存活 + 健康探测
    alt 应用成功
        AG->>HUB: config_apply_result(success)
        HUB->>SV: ConfigVersion.status=success
        SV-->>UI: 下发成功
    else 应用失败
        AG->>AG: 回滚 config.json.bak -> reload
        AG->>HUB: config_apply_result(failed, error)
        HUB->>SV: ConfigVersion.status=rolled_back
        SV-->>UI: 下发失败(可重试/回滚)
    end

    Note over UI,SB: 场景B：节点接入注册

    AG->>API: register(token, hostinfo, singbox_version)
    API->>API: 校验令牌 hash
    API->>DB: 更新节点状态 online + last_heartbeat
    API-->>AG: register_ack(配置推送或 pending)
    loop 每 5s
        AG->>API: heartbeat(流量摘要)
        API->>DB: 更新 last_heartbeat
    end

    Note over UI,SB: 场景C：订阅拉取与流量统计

    UI->>API: GET /sub/:token (公开)
    API->>SV: 校验订阅令牌 -> 定位 ProxyUser
    SV->>DB: 读分组 inbounds/outbounds + 解密用户 UUID
    SV->>SV: Generate() 生成用户订阅配置
    SV-->>UI: 返回订阅配置

    AG->>HUB: traffic_report(node_id, per inbound/outbound/up/down)
    HUB->>DB: 写 traffic_record
    DB->>DB: 按 UUID 聚合用户流量 + 更新 used_bytes
